{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Letter of Complaint", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Apologizing Using <span class=\"italic\">Should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Supposed to</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> to apologize for something you have done or to talk about obligations.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "An obligation is something you should do or that other people expect you to do.<br/><br/> You use the verb \u201cto be\u201d in front of <span class=\"strong\">supposed to</span>:<br/> - verb \u201cto be\u201d + supposed to + verb<br/><br/> or<br/><br/> You can use the modal <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to also show obligation, duty and correctness.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The waiter is supposed to take my order.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I should have been more welcoming.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "What am I supposed to do now?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The restaurant should apologize for their poor service.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I was supposed to open the door for customers.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future with <span class=\"italic\">will, going to,</span> the Present Continuous and the Present Simple", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<il><li>When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.<br/><br/> </li>  <li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to.</span><br/><br/></li> <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.<br/><br/>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Verb Tense</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> Example</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future Tense (Will)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I will contact the newspaper that published your advertisement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I am going to write an online review of your restaurant.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are planning to book a table at that new Italian restaurant later today.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I recommend that you organize a high chair before we arrive at 6 p.m.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "establishment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place or organization where people live or do business", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We will never come back or recommend your establishment. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you would use in a complaint letter.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "deceptive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "intended to make someone believe something that is not true", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We are going to complete an online review so that others are wary of deceptive advertising techniques. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "atrocious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very evil or cruel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: His atrocious behavior led to him being removed from the restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scam", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a dishonest way to make money by deceiving people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I will be sure to spread the word to them and others about this scam.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "crayon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a stick of colored wax that is used for drawing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  My daughter was not given a coloring book or crayons. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "portion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the amount of food that is served to a person at one time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You say that children that eat at Food and Fun are served child-sized portions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "restless", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling nervous or bored and tending to move around a lot", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She got restless and began to cry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to chastise", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to criticize someone harshly for doing something wrong", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I was even chastised for taking my daughter to a restaurant after 7p.m.!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Interview a friend or family member about a time that they received poor service.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take detailed notes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a 120-150 word letter of complaint to the business based on your notes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write sentences to explain what you will and won't be doing in the future. (Present Continuous tense, Future, <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span>, Present)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the words should and supposed to describe what the business should have done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I interview a friend or family member about when they received poor service.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take detailed notes in a conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a letter of complaint.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can write a letter of complaint.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about food and drink at a restaurant.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about things I am supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had poor customer service at a restaurant? What happened?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What should the business have done?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Writing Spot: Where is the manager? This is not acceptable!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type